{"seq":3,"slug":"authentication-authorization","title":"认证与授权模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/authentication-authorization","wordCount":1090,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"认证与授权模式\">认证与授权模式</h1><p>API 安全的核心问题只有两个：<strong>你是谁</strong>（认证/Authentication）和<strong>你能做什么</strong>（授权/Authorization）。认证确认身份，授权决定权限——两者在实现上经常被混淆，但在设计上必须清晰分离。2026 年的趋势是：OAuth 2.1 统一并简化了授权码流程，API Key 仍在服务间通信中不可替代，而 Token 生命周期管理成为安全架构的核心关注点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>认证与授权构成了 API 安全的两层防线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[客户端请求] --&gt; B[认证层: 你是谁?]&#10;    B --&gt;|失败| C[401 Unauthorized]&#10;    B --&gt;|成功| D[授权层: 你能做什么?]&#10;    D --&gt;|无权限| E[403 Forbidden]&#10;    D --&gt;|有权限| F[执行业务逻辑]&#10;    F --&gt; G[200 OK]\">graph TB\n    A[客户端请求] --&gt; B[认证层: 你是谁?]\n    B --&gt;|失败| C[401 Unauthorized]\n    B --&gt;|成功| D[授权层: 你能做什么?]\n    D --&gt;|无权限| E[403 Forbidden]\n    D --&gt;|有权限| F[执行业务逻辑]\n    F --&gt; G[200 OK]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>认证方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>安全级别</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API Key</td>\n<td>服务间通信、开发者平台</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bearer Token (JWT)</td>\n<td>用户认证、SPA/Mobile</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OAuth 2.1</td>\n<td>第三方授权、委托访问</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mTLS</td>\n<td>服务网格内部通信</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Session Cookie</td>\n<td>传统 Web 应用</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"api-key-认证\">API Key 认证</h2><p>API Key 是最简单的认证形式——一个随机生成的长字符串，通过请求头传递：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /v1/products&#10;X-API-Key: sk_live_4eC39HqLyjWDarjtT1zdp7dc\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /v1/products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-API-Key: sk_live_4eC39HqLyjWDarjtT1zdp7dc</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"设计要点\">设计要点</h3><p><strong>Key 的命名前缀</strong>揭示其用途，防止误用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>sk_live_</code> — 生产环境密钥（Secret Key）</li>\n<li><code>sk_test_</code> — 测试环境密钥</li>\n<li><code>pk_live_</code> — 客户端可公开密钥（Public Key）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Key 的存储</strong>：服务端只存储 Key 的哈希值（SHA-256），即使数据库泄露也无法还原原始 Key。Key 只在创建时完整展示一次。</p>\n<p><strong>Key 的能力控制</strong>：每个 Key 绑定一组权限（scope），遵循最小权限原则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;key_id&quot;: &quot;key_abc123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scopes&quot;: [&quot;products:read&quot;, &quot;orders:read&quot;, &quot;orders:write&quot;],&#10;  &quot;rate_limit&quot;: 1000,&#10;  &quot;allowed_ips&quot;: [&quot;203.0.113.0/24&quot;],&#10;  &quot;expires_at&quot;: &quot;2027-01-01T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"key_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key_abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scopes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"products:read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders:read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders:write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"allowed_ips\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"203.0.113.0/24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"api-key-的局限\">API Key 的局限</h3><p>API Key 本质上是&quot;长期凭据&quot;——一旦泄露，在被撤销前攻击者可以无限使用。它不携带用户身份信息，不支持细粒度权限委托，不适合面向终端用户的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bearer-token-与-jwt\">Bearer Token 与 JWT</h2><p>JWT（JSON Web Token）是 2026 年最广泛使用的 Bearer Token 格式。它将身份信息编码在 Token 本身中，服务端无需查库即可验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /v1/users/me&#10;Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyXzQyIi...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /v1/users/me</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyXzQyIi...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"jwt-的结构\">JWT 的结构</h3><p>JWT 由三部分 Base64 编码组成：<code>Header.Payload.Signature</code></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// Header&#10;{ &quot;alg&quot;: &quot;RS256&quot;, &quot;typ&quot;: &quot;JWT&quot;, &quot;kid&quot;: &quot;key-2026-07&quot; }&#10;&#10;// Payload&#10;{&#10;  &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;user_42&quot;,&#10;  &quot;iss&quot;: &quot;https://auth.example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aud&quot;: &quot;https://api.example.com&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exp&quot;: 1719936000,&#10;  &quot;iat&quot;: 1719932400,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;read:users write:orders&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RS256\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"typ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JWT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"key-2026-07\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Payload</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sub\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"iss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://auth.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aud\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://api.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1719936000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"iat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1719932400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"read:users write:orders\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"access-token-refresh-token-双-token-模式\">Access Token + Refresh Token 双 Token 模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Token 类型</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Access Token</td>\n<td>短（15min-1h）</td>\n<td>内存 / Authorization 头</td>\n<td>API 调用认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Refresh Token</td>\n<td>长（7-30 天）</td>\n<td>HttpOnly Cookie / 安全存储</td>\n<td>换取新 Access Token</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant A as Auth Server&#10;    participant R as Resource Server&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: POST /token (credentials)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: access_token + refresh_token&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;R: GET /api (Bearer access_token)&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;C: 200 OK&#10;    Note over C,R: access_token 过期...&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;A: POST /token (refresh_token)&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: new access_token\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant A as Auth Server\n    participant R as Resource Server\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: POST /token (credentials)\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: access_token + refresh_token\n    C-&gt;&gt;R: GET /api (Bearer access_token)\n    R-&gt;&gt;C: 200 OK\n    Note over C,R: access_token 过期...\n    C-&gt;&gt;A: POST /token (refresh_token)\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: new access_token</pre><p><strong>为什么 Access Token 要短命？</strong> 即使 Token 泄露，窗口期只有 15 分钟。而 Refresh Token 存储在更安全的位置（HttpOnly Cookie 不可被 XSS 读取），且每次使用可被轮换（Rotation）检测盗用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oauth-2-1-授权框架\">OAuth 2.1 授权框架</h2><p>OAuth 2.1（RFC 起草中，预计 2026 正式发布）整合了 OAuth 2.0 多年的安全实践，废弃了不安全的流程：</p>\n<p><strong>保留的授权流程：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Authorization Code + PKCE — SPA / 移动端 / 服务端的统一推荐流程</li>\n<li>Client Credentials — 服务间 M2M 通信</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>废弃的流程：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implicit Grant（Token 暴露在 URL fragment 中）</li>\n<li>Resource Owner Password Grant（客户端直接收集密码）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pkce-的必要性\">PKCE 的必要性</h3><p>PKCE（Proof Key for Code Exchange）防止授权码被拦截后冒用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 客户端生成 code_verifier（随机字符串）&#10;2. 计算 code_challenge = SHA256(code_verifier)&#10;3. 授权请求携带 code_challenge&#10;4. Token 请求携带 code_verifier&#10;5. 授权服务器验证 SHA256(code_verifier) == 存储的 code_challenge\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 客户端生成 code_verifier（随机字符串）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 计算 code_challenge = SHA256(code_verifier)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 授权请求携带 code_challenge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. Token 请求携带 code_verifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 授权服务器验证 SHA256(code_verifier) == 存储的 code_challenge</span></span></code></pre></div><p>即使攻击者拦截了授权码，没有 <code>code_verifier</code> 也无法换取 Token。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于角色与属性的授权\">基于角色与属性的授权</h2><h3 id=\"rbac-基于角色的访问控制\">RBAC（基于角色的访问控制）</h3><p>用户 → 角色 → 权限的映射关系。简单场景足够：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;user&quot;: &quot;alice&quot;,&#10;  &quot;roles&quot;: [&quot;editor&quot;],&#10;  &quot;permissions&quot;: [&quot;articles:read&quot;, &quot;articles:write&quot;, &quot;articles:publish&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"roles\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"editor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"permissions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"articles:read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"articles:write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"articles:publish\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"abac-基于属性的访问控制\">ABAC（基于属性的访问控制）</h3><p>当授权决策依赖上下文属性时（&quot;只能编辑自己创建的文章&quot;、&quot;工作时间内才能访问&quot;），需要 ABAC：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"IF   user.role == &quot;editor&quot;&#10;AND  resource.author_id == user.id&#10;AND  current_time IN working_hours&#10;THEN allow(&quot;articles:write&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>IF   user.role == \"editor\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>AND  resource.author_id == user.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>AND  current_time IN working_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>THEN allow(\"articles:write\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"api-中的权限检查模式\">API 中的权限检查模式</h3><p>权限检查应发生在<strong>业务逻辑之前、认证之后</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 路由中间件组合&#10;app.put(&#10;  &#39;/articles/:id&#39;,&#10;  authenticate(), // 401 if no valid token&#10;  authorize(&#39;articles:write&#39;), // 403 if no permission&#10;  checkOwnership(), // 403 if not owner (ABAC)&#10;  updateArticleHandler, // business logic&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由中间件组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '/articles/:id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  authenticate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 401 if no valid token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  authorize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'articles:write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 403 if no permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  checkOwnership</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 403 if not owner (ABAC)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updateArticleHandler, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// business logic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"速率限制作为安全层\">速率限制作为安全层</h2><p>速率限制（Rate Limiting）既是资源保护也是安全措施。标准的速率限制头部：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;X-RateLimit-Limit: 1000&#10;X-RateLimit-Remaining: 997&#10;X-RateLimit-Reset: 1719936000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Limit: 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Remaining: 997</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Reset: 1719936000</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当超出限制时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests&#10;Retry-After: 30&#10;X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 429 Too Many Requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Retry-After: 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X-RateLimit-Remaining: 0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见的限流策略：Token Bucket（令牌桶）和 Sliding Window（滑动窗口）。按 API Key、用户 ID、IP 地址分别计数，防止单一维度被绕过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>认证（你是谁）和授权（你能做什么）必须设计上分离</li>\n<li>API Key 适合服务间通信，JWT Bearer Token 适合用户认证</li>\n<li>Access Token 短命 + Refresh Token 长命的双 Token 模式平衡了安全与体验</li>\n<li>OAuth 2.1 统一推荐 Authorization Code + PKCE，废弃 Implicit 和 Password Grant</li>\n<li>RBAC 覆盖基础场景，ABAC 处理上下文相关的细粒度授权</li>\n<li>速率限制是 API 安全的最后一道防线，必须返回标准头部指导客户端行为</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"idempotency-retry\">幂等性与重试设计</a> — 认证失败后的重试策略与安全考量</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../frontend/frontend-security-engineering/session/auth-tokens-cookies\">前端安全：认证令牌与 Cookie</a> — 从前端视角看 Token 的安全存储与传输</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"认证与授权模式","id":"认证与授权模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"API Key 认证","id":"api-key-认证"},{"level":3,"text":"设计要点","id":"设计要点"},{"level":3,"text":"API Key 的局限","id":"api-key-的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"Bearer Token 与 JWT","id":"bearer-token-与-jwt"},{"level":3,"text":"JWT 的结构","id":"jwt-的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Access Token + Refresh Token 双 Token 模式","id":"access-token-refresh-token-双-token-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"OAuth 2.1 授权框架","id":"oauth-2-1-授权框架"},{"level":3,"text":"PKCE 的必要性","id":"pkce-的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"基于角色与属性的授权","id":"基于角色与属性的授权"},{"level":3,"text":"RBAC（基于角色的访问控制）","id":"rbac-基于角色的访问控制"},{"level":3,"text":"ABAC（基于属性的访问控制）","id":"abac-基于属性的访问控制"},{"level":3,"text":"API 中的权限检查模式","id":"api-中的权限检查模式"},{"level":2,"text":"速率限制作为安全层","id":"速率限制作为安全层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"幂等性与重试设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/patterns/idempotency-retry"},"next":{"title":"错误设计与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/error-design"}}